    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what's even the point of \"getting help\" to just go back to this? back to a life that feels totally hollow. it's like i'm just running on empty and there's no more fuel. everything feels so heavy and pointless. sometimes it feels like the most logical thing would be to just... let go. to just finally have some peace.",
